2026-08-25T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-1028) 'Model license gate
 # uuid: c7a75c08-2b67-5be6-aa65-d02ca7ced5e1
 # tags: rfd:title, rfd:attest-in:none
 RFD:Published  1 RFD
 Serials:Weftspun

2026-08-25T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-1028) 'model licensing
 # tags: rfd:feature, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-1028) 'Models for paying users clear one hard commercial-use gate first.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1028) 'Some model weights permit non-commercial use only, and some carry territory rules and user-count rules. Shipped to paying users, either breaks the license.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1028) 'Check a new model against the commercial-use gate in MODEL_LICENSES.md before it ships to paying users, and read RFD66606-1029 for the FOSS replacements.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-1028) 'Model license gate
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-1028) 'Any model shipped to paying users must clear commercial use. The gate is the hard prerequisite in MODEL_LICENSES.md. The repository keeps a FOSS blocklist for permissive licenses only.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-1028) 'RFD66606-1016 lists the active models. RFD66606-1029 gives the FOSS replacements. RFD66606-1035 lists the legacy models. The license audit is docs/MODEL_LICENSES.md in AlfaOmegaGrafx/3DAIGC-API.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-1028) 'Deleted models
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-1028) 'PartField, PartPacker, and FastMesh fail the gate. Their weight licenses permit non-commercial use only.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-1028) '- PartField uses the NVIDIA license section 3.3.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-1028) '- PartPacker uses the NVIDIA Source Code License section 3.3.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-1028) '- FastMesh uses the S-Lab non-commercial license.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-1028) 'The pass tracks in issue #6. These models are not in the catalog. The repository does not reference them in the UI. Their residual references remain in docs/api/api.md. The delete pass removes them.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-1028) 'Blocklisted models
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-1028) '- hunyuan3dv21_image_to_raw_mesh uses the Tencent Community license. The license has territory and MAU rules. The blocklist removes it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-1028) '- ultrashape_image_to_raw_mesh inherits the Hunyuan pipelines. It inherits the Tencent rules. Review it with the same gate.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-1028) '- hunyuan3dv21_image_to_textured_mesh uses the same Tencent license. It needs the same review.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-1028) '- hunyuan3dv21_image_mesh_painting uses the same Tencent license. It needs the same review.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-1028) '- CGAL uses the GPL license with a commercial dual license. The project excludes GPL on license grounds. The blocklist removes it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-1028) 'The FOSS replacement for raw mesh generation is TRELLIS.2. It uses the MIT license. The catalog already carries it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-1028) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-1028) 'The catalog must not ship them to paying users.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1028  1 LINE
 Text:Written
